WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.791 --> 00:00:32.000
In the previous verse, Lord Krishna explained

2
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.916
the importance of remembering
 Him at the time of death.

3
00:00:34.916 --> 00:00:37.500
In this verse, He further clarifies

4
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:41.875
that this remembrance should
 be a continuous process,

5
00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:44.125
not just an effort made

6
00:00:44.125 --> 00:00:46.041
in the final moment.

7
00:00:46.041 --> 00:00:48.958
Arjuna might have had a doubt –

8
00:00:48.958 --> 00:00:50.375
'Lord Krishna is asking him

9
00:00:50.375 --> 00:00:52.291
to just remember Him

10
00:00:52.291 --> 00:00:55.375
and telling him not to fight.'

11
00:00:55.375 --> 00:00:57.916
The solution to Arjuna's this doubt

12
00:00:57.916 --> 00:00:59.875
is also found in this verse.

13
00:01:04.916 --> 00:01:07.708
In this verse (8.7), Lord Krishna explains

14
00:01:07.708 --> 00:01:09.416
that even while performing

15
00:01:09.416 --> 00:01:10.583
our prescribed duties,

16
00:01:10.583 --> 00:01:13.250
we should keep remembering

17
00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:15.166
Lord Krishna.

18
00:01:15.166 --> 00:01:18.500
He gives Arjuna a direct instruction –

19
00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:21.250
'Remember Me continuously,

20
00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:23.875
even while performing the duty

21
00:01:23.875 --> 00:01:25.000
of fighting'

22
00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:28.750
meaning  mām anusmara yudhya ca.

23
00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:30.333
It's important

24
00:01:30.333 --> 00:01:33.291
that Lord Krishna isn't talking
 about withdrawing from battle,

25
00:01:33.291 --> 00:01:38.541
but fighting while remembering Him.

26
00:01:38.541 --> 00:01:41.458
The main point here is that
before performing karma,

27
00:01:41.458 --> 00:01:46.041
engaging the mind in God is necessary,

28
00:01:46.041 --> 00:01:48.458
not just offering karma's fruit

29
00:01:48.458 --> 00:01:50.250
to God later.

30
00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:52.750
From this perspective, ordinary duty

31
00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:55.958
performance also becomes acts of devotion.

32
00:01:55.958 --> 00:01:58.375
Lord Krishna clarifies that one should

33
00:01:58.375 --> 00:02:02.208
meditate on Him with both mind and intellect.

34
00:02:02.208 --> 00:02:04.041
When both mind and intellect

35
00:02:04.041 --> 00:02:06.125
are in meditation on Lord Krishna,

36
00:02:06.125 --> 00:02:09.125
then karma also becomes divine.

37
00:02:09.125 --> 00:02:10.583
Through daily prayer,

38
00:02:10.583 --> 00:02:12.666
meditation, and scripture study,

39
00:02:12.666 --> 00:02:16.125
we can train our mind

40
00:02:16.125 --> 00:02:17.208
so that Lord Krishna always

41
00:02:17.208 --> 00:02:19.833
remains at the center of our consciousness.

42
00:02:19.833 --> 00:02:23.000
Through this practice, even at the
time of death, our mind

43
00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:26.166
will naturally go toward Lord Krishna,

44
00:02:26.166 --> 00:02:30.750
and without any doubt we will obtain him.

45
00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.000
In essence,

46
00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:34.041
Lord Krishna teaches us

47
00:02:34.041 --> 00:02:36.500
that keeping Him always in remembrance,

48
00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:38.750
even while doing worldly work,

49
00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:40.583
we can be liberated.

50
00:02:40.583 --> 00:02:43.166
He assures by saying that

51
00:02:43.166 --> 00:02:45.416
whoever performs karma in this way

52
00:02:45.416 --> 00:02:47.875
will certainly go into His shelter.

53
00:02:47.875 --> 00:02:50.291
Making one's consciousness Krishna-filled

54
00:02:50.291 --> 00:02:52.375
is extremely important

55
00:02:52.375 --> 00:02:54.250
for spiritual success.

56
00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:02.125
Have you ever felt

57
00:03:02.125 --> 00:03:04.000
that spirituality

58
00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:07.500
and daily ordinary tasks

59
00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:11.166
are separate from each other?

60
00:03:11.166 --> 00:03:13.125
Actually,

61
00:03:13.125 --> 00:03:14.291
these are processes

62
00:03:14.291 --> 00:03:15.500
that walk

63
00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:18.583
hand in hand.

64
00:03:18.583 --> 00:03:20.750
Your spiritual practice

65
00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:24.583
doesn't remove you from your obligations,

66
00:03:24.583 --> 00:03:30.000
 rather it gives you power to fulfill
 them in a more meaningful way.

67
00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.666
Every day

68
00:03:31.666 --> 00:03:35.458
when you start your morning,

69
00:03:35.458 --> 00:03:38.166
do you spend some moments

70
00:03:38.166 --> 00:03:41.208
in My remembrance?

71
00:03:41.208 --> 00:03:45.500
Tell me? You know,

72
00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:47.333
this small practice

73
00:03:47.333 --> 00:03:51.000
can transform your entire day.

74
00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:53.000
Just as the sun

75
00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:57.916
removes night's darkness, similarly

76
00:03:57.916 --> 00:04:00.500
morning remembrance

77
00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:02.750
removes the darkness of delusion,

78
00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:06.416
doubt, and uncertainty,

79
00:04:06.416 --> 00:04:09.375
clearly showing the path

80
00:04:09.375 --> 00:04:12.083
to deal with the day's challenges.

81
00:04:12.083 --> 00:04:14.625
A person who every day,

82
00:04:14.625 --> 00:04:17.625
before going to their workplace,

83
00:04:17.625 --> 00:04:21.541
sits quietly for some moments

84
00:04:21.541 --> 00:04:23.958
and remembers Me,

85
00:04:23.958 --> 00:04:25.458
can bear the day's stress

86
00:04:25.458 --> 00:04:29.333
in a more balanced way.

87
00:04:29.333 --> 00:04:32.041
When some difficult decision must be made,

88
00:04:32.041 --> 00:04:36.083
then an intuition awakens within them,

89
00:04:36.083 --> 00:04:39.708
that shows them the right path.

90
00:04:39.708 --> 00:04:40.958
Remember,

91
00:04:40.958 --> 00:04:44.250
spirituality isn't the path of escaping life,

92
00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:48.375
it's the path of enriching life.

93
00:04:48.375 --> 00:04:52.250
Filling your mind with My remembrance,

94
00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:56.916
fulfill your duties with self-confidence.

95
00:05:01.916 --> 00:05:02.875
In family and

96
00:05:02.875 --> 00:05:06.750
society, creating the right balance

97
00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:09.500
between spiritual practice

98
00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:14.875
and daily activities is very important!

99
00:05:14.875 --> 00:05:18.375
Do you see these two as separate?

100
00:05:18.375 --> 00:05:21.625
On one side, there are some people who

101
00:05:21.625 --> 00:05:25.750
in the name of spirituality
 neglect family obligations.

102
00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:28.250
On the other side, there are such people

103
00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:31.041
who become so busy that

104
00:05:31.041 --> 00:05:35.458
they forget to even hear the soul's call.

105
00:05:35.458 --> 00:05:40.041
Both paths lead toward imbalance.

106
00:05:40.041 --> 00:05:42.083
I want you

107
00:05:42.083 --> 00:05:44.375
to understand

108
00:05:44.375 --> 00:05:47.791
that spirituality is that foundation

109
00:05:47.791 --> 00:05:52.791
on which all your activities rest.

110
00:05:52.791 --> 00:05:55.041
Just as a tree's roots,

111
00:05:55.041 --> 00:05:57.625
the stronger they are,

112
00:05:57.625 --> 00:06:02.375
the more fruitful its branches,

113
00:06:02.375 --> 00:06:06.083
similarly from spiritual roots alone

114
00:06:06.083 --> 00:06:11.166
family relationships flourish.

115
00:06:11.166 --> 00:06:13.916
When you rise in the morning and spend some

116
00:06:13.916 --> 00:06:18.416
time with Me, meaning

117
00:06:18.416 --> 00:06:20.625
remember Me,

118
00:06:20.625 --> 00:06:23.833
then throughout the day you can behave

119
00:06:23.833 --> 00:06:26.125
with more patience,

120
00:06:26.125 --> 00:06:30.291
love, and understanding with your family.

121
00:06:30.291 --> 00:06:32.458
Whether affection for children

122
00:06:32.458 --> 00:06:35.250
or service of the elderly, in every

123
00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:38.875
action new enthusiasm comes.

124
00:06:38.875 --> 00:06:40.666
Keep in mind,

125
00:06:40.666 --> 00:06:42.583
balance isn't neglecting

126
00:06:42.583 --> 00:06:46.791
one side for the other side,

127
00:06:46.791 --> 00:06:50.125
it's coexistence of both,

128
00:06:50.125 --> 00:06:51.875
where spirituality

129
00:06:51.875 --> 00:06:55.250
provides a solid foundation

130
00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:58.416
for performing all your duties.

131
00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:06.208
In your work field,

132
00:07:06.208 --> 00:07:10.500
how does real success come?

133
00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:16.916
From only hard work? Or from clever intellect?

134
00:07:16.916 --> 00:07:20.458
Actually, success comes

135
00:07:20.458 --> 00:07:24.916
when you thread your mind, brain, and hands –

136
00:07:24.916 --> 00:07:28.708
all three in one string.

137
00:07:28.708 --> 00:07:32.416
Just as I told Arjuna –

138
00:07:32.416 --> 00:07:36.458
'Even while doing battle, meaning your karma,

139
00:07:36.458 --> 00:07:38.708
keep remembering

140
00:07:38.708 --> 00:07:41.333
Me,'

141
00:07:41.333 --> 00:07:46.083
similarly the message for you is –

142
00:07:46.083 --> 00:07:47.666
always maintain harmony

143
00:07:47.666 --> 00:07:51.500
in your intellect, emotions,

144
00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:54.625
and actions.

145
00:07:54.625 --> 00:07:57.708
Just take a skilled manager.

146
00:07:57.708 --> 00:08:00.625
Every day before starting their work,

147
00:08:00.625 --> 00:08:04.583
they peacefully make strategy

148
00:08:04.583 --> 00:08:08.708
with their brain, meaning intellect,

149
00:08:08.708 --> 00:08:10.208
then

150
00:08:10.208 --> 00:08:14.958
with kindheartedness inspire their team

151
00:08:14.958 --> 00:08:16.083
to work with enthusiasm,

152
00:08:16.083 --> 00:08:19.791
sensitivity, and care.

153
00:08:19.791 --> 00:08:21.291
Result?

154
00:08:21.291 --> 00:08:24.041
Not only business success, but

155
00:08:24.041 --> 00:08:27.166
such a work environment where

156
00:08:27.166 --> 00:08:31.166
everyone works with joy.

157
00:08:31.166 --> 00:08:33.833
When your mind remains centered in Me

158
00:08:33.833 --> 00:08:35.291
and your heart

159
00:08:35.291 --> 00:08:38.125
is filled with pure resolves,

160
00:08:38.125 --> 00:08:41.458
then your actions become more impactful

161
00:08:41.458 --> 00:08:44.166
and meaningful.

162
00:08:44.166 --> 00:08:49.166
If even one of these is lacking,

163
00:08:49.166 --> 00:08:52.583
then either direction is lost, or inspiration,

164
00:08:52.583 --> 00:08:56.000
or you become discouraged.

165
00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:57.916
Therefore,

166
00:08:57.916 --> 00:09:01.708
before starting your day,

167
00:09:01.708 --> 00:09:02.791
focus your thoughts

168
00:09:02.791 --> 00:09:06.041
for some moments

169
00:09:06.041 --> 00:09:10.791
and keep experiencing Me indirectly.

170
00:09:10.791 --> 00:09:13.583
Then work with coordination

171
00:09:13.583 --> 00:09:18.541
of your mind, brain, and work's activities.

172
00:09:18.541 --> 00:09:22.583
Through this work style, not only success comes

173
00:09:22.583 --> 00:09:26.875
but also professional excellence.

174
00:09:26.875 --> 00:09:29.833
Your work moves toward completion

175
00:09:29.833 --> 00:09:32.791
with a meaningful purpose.
